<title>USA: Inter-Tel to repurchase up to 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Inter-Tel to repurchase up to 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Tel Inc said on Wednesday that its board of directors has approved the purchase of up to two million additional shares of its common stock by the company in the open market from time to time, depending upon market conditions.</p>
<p>The company said it recently completed the repurchase of 1,470,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 11.7 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>Shares were trading at 24 as of Wednesday's market close.</p>
</text>
